{"type":"message","id":"14e36288","parentId":"0a1fba14","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:47:47.840Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Tried it with `--yes` too. Same result: your version advertises `--generate-gateway-token`, but it still just runs doctor and doesn’t actually show or configure a token.\n\nThis looks like one of:\n- a broken/no-op flag in `2026.3.23`\n- token generation happening silently somewhere else\n- a follow-up command needed\n\nIf you want, I can dig one step deeper by checking the local docs/source/help for where gateway tokens are actually created on this install.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08411530fdf714900169c1a6f21310819b99bd6789e6a7b84f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1362,"output":112,"cacheRead":14848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16322,"cost":{"input":0.0034050000000000005,"output":0.00168,"cacheRead":0.003712,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.008797000000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774298863302,"responseId":"resp_08411530fdf714900169c1a6f00ad8819b893e10d3eb8302b1"}}
