{"type":"message","id":"3b142697","parentId":"c2226ca3","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:50:46.484Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Short version: there probably isn’t a real “unlimited memory” plugin. The good option is a **vector-backed memory setup** with sane tiering, not a magic infinite-memory add-on.\n\nFrom the ClawHub results here, the ones most worth looking at are:\n- **memory-qdrant** — best bet if you want scalable semantic memory\n- **memory-lancedb-hybrid** — good if you want local-ish hybrid search\n- **openclaw-mem / openclaw-memorybox** — worth checking, but the names are generic enough that I’d inspect before trusting\n- **memory-tiering** — useful if you want short/long-term separation\n- **elite-longterm-memory** — flashy name; I’d treat it skeptically until verified\n\nMy honest recommendation:\n1. **Best practical choice:** `memory-qdrant`\n   - scalable\n   - good fit for large memory stores\n   - better than “unlimited memory” marketing nonsense\n\n2. **Best simpler/local choice:** `memory-lancedb-hybrid`\n   - easier if you want fewer moving parts\n   - hybrid retrieval can be nice\n\n3. **Best companion utility:** `memory-tiering`\n   - helps keep recall useful instead of just hoarding everything\n\nWhat I would *not* optimize for:\n- anything claiming “unlimited” as the main feature\n- vague memory plugins with no clear backend/search model\n- giant memory without hygiene, because retrieval quality usually gets worse\n\nIf you want, I can do the next useful step:\n- **audit the top 3 skill packages** and tell you which one is actually solid, or\n- **install the best one** for your setup.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08411530fdf714900169c1a79d8f80819b9f5f2451cf4f9cbc\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":628,"output":359,"cacheRead":17024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18011,"cost":{"input":0.0015700000000000002,"output":0.005385,"cacheRead":0.004256,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011211}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774299035646,"responseId":"resp_08411530fdf714900169c1a79c88b8819b9904fc6e08fb3a4a"}}
